{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOFoxyRough\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOFoxyRough","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"This FoxyRough theme is a theme with tints of red and gray, “Lipstick on a Grey Suit”.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The FoxyRough theme uses the WinkyRoug font family"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The FoxyRough theme does not embed charts colors yet, and is read only: it cannot be suclassed or derivated.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important"},{"level":2,"text":"How to use the theme","type":"heading","anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOFoxyRough\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOFoxyRough\/FoxyRoughTheme","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" directly. To use the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOFoxyRough\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOFoxyRough\/FoxyRoughTheme","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" without further modifications, you will have to use the "},{"code":"MISOThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for your root view and give it an instance of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesMISOFoxyRough\/documentation\/MISOThemesMISOFoxyRough\/FoxyRoughTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Keep in mind the themes are "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift class objects"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and can be heavy, so you may use only as instance as singleton and not store any properties."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            MISOThemeableView(theme: FoxyRoughTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, in your views, you can simply use the theme through an environment variable to get the tokens:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    \/\/ Get MISO environment variable for theme thanks to themeable view","    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","    ","    var body: some View {","        ","        \/\/ Use the theme to retrieve the tokens","        \/\/ For spaces: theme.spaces","        \/\/ For sizes: theme.sizes","        \/\/ For borders: theme.borders","        \/\/ For elevations: theme.elevations","        \/\/ For opacities: theme.opacities","        \/\/ For colors: theme.colors","        \/\/ For button configuration: theme.button","        \/\/ For link configuration: theme.link","        \/\/ Etc.","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"How it looks like","anchor":"How-it-looks-like","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"text":"Actions","anchor":"Actions","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_FoxyRough.png","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Content display","anchor":"Content-display","type":"heading"},{"level":4,"text":"Bullet list","anchor":"Bullet-list","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_bullet_list_FoxyRough.png"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Controls","anchor":"Controls","type":"heading"},{"level":4,"text":"Checkboxes","anchor":"Checkboxes","type":"heading"},{"tabs":[{"title":"Checkbox","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_checkbox_FoxyRough.png","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Checkbox item","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_checkboxItem_FoxyRough.png"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"level":4,"text":"R